msgid "HLB Ability Registry for MCP"
msgstr ""

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: hlb-ability-registry-mcp.php
msgid "https://github.com/jdbg/hlb-ability-registry-mcp"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
#: hlb-ability-registry-mcp.php
msgid ""
"Exposes a curated, admin-controlled set of WordPress Abilities to the MCP "
"Adapter so third-party tools and AI agents can interact with the site over "
"MCP. Multisite-ready with network defaults and per-subsite overrides. "
"Source: https://github.com/jdbg/hlb-ability-registry-mcp"
msgstr ""
"Предоставя подбран набор от WordPress Abilities, контролирани от "
"администратора, на MCP Adapter, за да могат инструменти на трети страни и AI "
"агенти да взаимодействат със сайта чрез MCP. Готово за мрежи от сайтове "
"(multisite) с мрежови настройки по подразбиране и изключения за отделни "
"сайтове."

#. Author of the plugin
#: hlb-ability-registry-mcp.php
msgid "Jordan Hlebarov"
msgstr ""

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: hlb-ability-registry-mcp.php
#, fuzzy
msgid "https://jdbg.com/"
msgstr "https://hlebarov.com/"

