#: inc/class-admin.php:482
msgid "Frontend Gatekeeper"
msgstr "Frontend Gatekeeper"

#: inc/class-admin.php:485
msgid ""
"Detected. If its gate is enabled, permalinks and site URLs returned by "
"abilities are automatically tagged with its access parameter so agents can "
"follow them without hitting its 404 gate."
msgstr ""
"Открита. Ако нейната бариера е активна, постоянните връзки и URL адресите на "
